      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Masterclasses provide a unique opportunity to experience and better understand an art form. This is your chance to learn more about the artistry of opera as you watch talented vocalists perform arias, songs and scenes, receiving expert, real-time feedback from our esteemed vocal coaches."
      }
