      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "There is always laughter, music, and unforgettable fun when the legendary Al Simmons takes the stage. Known for his off-the-wall humor, whimsical songs, and magical performances, Al has been delighting audiences for over 55 years."
      }
