        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Enjoy a relaxed and open conversation between Mark Fewer and acclaimed pianist Michael Kaeshammer as they talk music, creativity, and life on and off the stage. Pour yourself a cup of Plugged In, our signature Stratford Summer Music brew, and settle in for a candid chat full of insight, humour, and"
