      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "World-renowned pianist John Novacek returns to Stratford Summer Music with the jazz-era masterpiece, George Gershwin’s Rhapsody in Blue. This iconic work is a brilliant fusion of classical and jazz styles, full of vigour and vitality. In Novacek’s very capable hands, this is sure to be an outstandin"
