      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join the Bayfield Ukulele Society for a sunny, feel-good afternoon of music on the MusicBarge. This joyful group of ukulele enthusiasts brings infectious energy and charm to every performance, strumming their way through familiar favourites, toe-tapping tunes, and sing-along classics."
      }
